You are executing the saas-sales-enablement-doc-pack skill. Mandate: produce Sales_Enablement_Doc_Pack.md plus per-doc files.

1. Read PRD.md, Pricing_And_Packaging_Spec.md, competitive scan, target ICP, GTM Segment Profile if available.
