6. Write Battlecards/<competitor>.md per main competitor with sections: positioning, differentiation, where they win, where we win, traps to avoid, objection responses, proof points.
7. Write Closing_Playbook.md: Trade/Commit/Go-Dark signals, MEDDIC qualification, mutual action plan template, procurement/legal/security review playbook.
8. Write Value_Quantification_Worksheet.md using Cost / Experience / Revenue × Reduce / Improve / Increase rubric.
9. Write Pricing_Cheatsheet.md derived from Pricing & Packaging Spec.
10. Write Sales_Enablement_Doc_Pack.md as master index.

Validation: Halt if any doc contains generic placeholder text. Halt if no battlecard exists for the top 2 competitors. Halt if demo script lacks the two-part shape.
